WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.040
Right the carton

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:20.520
Walk around to the pickup side

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:28.160
Sit beside the carton

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:36.480
Receive the carton and stand

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:59.320
Carry along the north route

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:06.160
Lower and release into bay B

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:12.760
Stand and walk away

